<title>USA: China Tire CEO resigns, successor named.</title>
<headline>China Tire CEO resigns, successor named.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Tire Holdings Ltd said Thursday that Mar Shaw Hsiang has resigned as chief executive and president because of health reasons.</p>
<p>The company said its board has named Chief Operating Officer Tan Sheng Hsuin as president and acting chief executive.</p>
